    {
      "s": "The Greek equivalent of L, Lambda, is represented by an upside down V shape.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "757692_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "The Ancient Greeks actually had a fun victory dance of their own.  They would take their conquered foes, stick them inside a hollow bronze bull statue placed over a bonfire until they were slowly baked alive from within.  Hilarious!",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "757693_2",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Say I want to tell someone to “take the GREEK L”.  What shape should I make on my forehead while dancing around like a doof?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "757689_2",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
  ]
